{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "238aa29a0440131b",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 2270,
			"y": 865,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 395,
			"label": "Labels (from lidar, never an input)",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "e6d2f5a368082ea3",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 2270,
			"y": -70,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 895,
			"label": "Head input x: 4 channels in this run",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "4a053ffcd96aa49d",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1790,
			"y": -70,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 1330,
			"label": "Load time (ConfidenceDataset, per run)"
		},
		{
			"id": "0b5554c871e6f62b",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1310,
			"y": -70,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 1330,
			"label": "confcache entry (nuscenes-trainval)",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "8cea433c9213abfb",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 450,
			"y": -70,
			"width": 780,
			"height": 1330,
			"label": "Cache build (once per image, same for every run)"
		},
		{
			"id": "5eee643a4201bf7c",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -30,
			"y": -70,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 1330,
			"label": "nuScenes (raw data)"
		},
		{
			"id": "938010d303e7da88",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# `m1-no-features`\n\nThe 64 decoder features are **off**. The head sees only the 4 other channels.\n\n**On:** depth (1), temporal spread (1), radar (2)\n\n**Off:** decoder features (64)\n\n**Head input:** 4 channels",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 860,
			"height": 380
		},
		{
			"id": "564c0ee4d74f94ad",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Question\n\nWhat do the decoder features add?\n\n**Flags added to the default config:** `--set inputs.features=false`\n\n**Checkpoint:** `nathancbao/confhead/m1-no-features` on Hugging Face",
			"x": 920,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 800,
			"height": 380
		},
		{
			"id": "f6aabd41a9140367",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Result\n\nBest dev loss **0.6167**, +0.0601 over the baseline. This is the largest drop of any single group: the decoder features carry most of the signal.\n\nDev loss only shows that a run learned. The Eval team's AUSE and AURG on the val split decide which run is best.",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 860,
			"height": 380
		},
		{
			"id": "9b0899346014f5b9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Legend\n\nRead left to right: raw data, cache build, cache, load time, head.\n\n- Orange: raw nuScenes data\n- Purple: a computation\n- Cyan: an array stored in the confcache\n- Green: a channel the head reads in this run\n- Red: switched off, or changed, in this run\n- Yellow: labels and output\n\nCompare with the baseline: [[run-v1-radar.canvas|run-v1-radar]]",
			"x": 2700,
			"y": -520,
			"width": 880,
			"height": 380
		},
		{
			"id": "3a230e2fba993645",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Camera keyframe image**\n\n`[3, 900, 1600]`\n\nOne of 6 cameras.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "a35350c862b633f1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Neighbor frames and camera poses**\n\nFrames at offsets -2, -1, +1, +2 (12 Hz)",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "5ffc41b6e98eb1d2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Radar points**\n\n5 radars, the last 5 sweeps each, about 94 points per image.\n\nDepth in meters, but no elevation.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "069cee86005fc67f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Lidar points**\n\nDepth in meters. The ground truth: it makes the labels and is never an input of the head.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "8d3900e9f01569a3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Frozen Depth Anything V2 (ViT-B)**\n\nDINOv2 encoder, then DPT decoder, on the image resized to 924 x 518.\n\nNever trained here.",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "4e6ce7197fec3b66",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Tap `output_conv1`**\n\nLast decoder feature map, 64 channels. Area-averaged to the grid.",
			"x": 860,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "f88c594a0fe93621",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Disparity output**\n\nRelative inverse depth, no units. Area-averaged to the grid.",
			"x": 860,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "570c07cd8e05f04a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**DA2 on the 4 neighbor frames**\n\n4 extra passes per image",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "6c6b2125a08c5d5a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**`temporal_variation`**\n\nFollow each cell's 3D point into the neighbors; std / mean of its inverse depth across frames.",
			"x": 860,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "7694a9b4058fdc8a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Project radar into the camera**\n\nEach point becomes (u, v, z) and takes DA2's disparity at its pixel.",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "ea17c9aa87cb31fa",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Radar fit**\n\nLeast squares for a scale and a shift that map DA2's disparity to 1 / z of the radar points.\n\nFails on 17% of images.",
			"x": 860,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "c3123a1f97fb30c8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Project lidar into the camera**\n\nEach point becomes (u, v, z) and takes DA2's disparity at its pixel.",
			"x": 480,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "29a441e9d589ab72",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Lidar fit**\n\nLeast squares for a scale and a shift that map DA2's disparity to 1 / z of the lidar points.",
			"x": 860,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "726875d7f38e62a6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`features`\n\n`[64, 148, 264]` float16",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "dafa3e4fd5df77fc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`disparity_grid`\n\n`[148, 264]` float32",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "f831ed0640868e3f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`temporal_relstd`\n\n`[148, 264]` float16",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "0acf10f18cf82bd3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`radar`\n\n`[N, 6]`: u, v, z, dt, sweep, disparity",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "58db13b4835348af",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`meta.fit_radar`\n\nscale, shift",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "1909c155669949d1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`lidar`\n\n`[N, 6]`: u, v, z, dt, sweep, disparity",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "ecb703eb726acc58",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`meta.fit_lidar`\n\nscale, shift",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 1070,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "2db61a30fde5ec5f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**`normalized_disparity`**\n\nDisparity over its image mean. No fit, no meters.",
			"x": 1820,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "68a5b0092fa2e922",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**`radar_channels`**\n\nAt each radar point: |fitted depth - z| / z.\n\nEach point fills 3 x 3 cells; every other cell is 0.",
			"x": 1820,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "eaef3116977e15ba",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**`lidar_labels`**\n\nAt each lidar point: abs_rel = |fitted depth - z| / z.\n\ntarget = 1 where abs_rel > tau (0.1). About 9% of cells hold a lidar point.",
			"x": 1820,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "80de1ca640254d70",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**OFF in this run**\n\n`feature_0` to `feature_63` (64)",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6702ae3541ee4f6a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`depth` (1)\n\nDA2's own prediction: the scene layout, near against far.",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "1631b7a5c1599967",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`temporal_relstd` (1)\n\nHow much DA2's depth of the same 3D point disagrees across frames.",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "8b5124c499545463",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`radar_residual` (1)\n\nHow far DA2's depth is from radar's.",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "b23843d01ee0cb5b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`radar_valid` (1)\n\n1 where the residual is a measurement.",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "a466f669716e5296",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`target` `[1, 148, 264]`\n\n1 where DA2's depth is off by more than 10%.",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "28c89c01f7043bee",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "`mask` `[1, 148, 264]`\n\n1 where the cell holds a lidar point.",
			"x": 2300,
			"y": 1070,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "625d67b419a52ce8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## ConfidenceHead\n\n`x: [B, 4, 148, 264]`\n\n1. Standardize each channel with the mean and std of the train split\n2. conv 3x3 to 64, ReLU\n3. conv 3x3 to 64, ReLU\n4. conv 3x3 to 32, ReLU\n5. conv 1x1 to 1 logit per cell\n\nThe only part that is trained.",
			"x": 2780,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 810,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "f1ba3ae0108bd03c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## p_error\n\n`[B, 1, 148, 264]`\n\nPer grid cell: the probability that DA2's depth is wrong by more than 10%. One cell covers about 6 x 6 image pixels.",
			"x": 3240,
			"y": 170,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "58dc48a61fc87a40",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Masked BCE loss**\n\nOver the labeled cells only. Positive cells are weighted by negatives / positives.",
			"x": 2780,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "033f44a5dced95bf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Training settings**\n\nAdamW, lr 0.001, cosine schedule, weight decay 0.0001\n\n8 epochs, batch 8, seed 0\n\nDev: 10% of the train scenes, picked by the seed",
			"x": 3240,
			"y": 900,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 300
		}
	],
